[h3][b]LOCALIZATION[/b][/h3]
* Languages added: [b]Spanish, German, French, Chinese (Simplified), Japanese, Korean, Portuguese (Brazil).[/b]

[h3][b]BUG FIXES[/b][/h3]
* Fixed a bug where handheld resources like metal sheets and wooden planks would fall through the floor tiles in the area around Earl;
* Fixed the pause and bug report windows conflicting with each other;
* Fixed a bug where a blueprint hologram would rotate along with the camera in the building mode;
* Fixed a bug where the main character would stop using the spray if the cursor hovered an interface element;
* Fixed a bug where a leech or weed would leave behind a weird zero ("0") upon dying 😦;
* Improvements for the build stability.

[h3][b]UI[/b][/h3]
* Various corrections and revisions of fonts, tooltips and icons;

[h3][b]SOUND[/b][/h3]
* Corrected the kettle disassembly sounds;
* Corrected some sounds in expeditions;
* Corrected sounds in the building menu.

[h2][b]Hey there, everyone![/b][/h2]

We want to thank everyone for providing feedback and helping us make the demo a better experience. Next week, we plan on releasing an update that will add more languages to the game: French, German, Spanish, Portuguese, Chinese, Japanese and Korean. Below is a list of changes for the freshly released patch. Enjoy the demo and don't hesitate to share your suggestions with us! And keep an eye on our announcements: we'll have [i]something interesting[/i] to share with you all soon.


[h3][b]EXPEDITIONS[/b][/h3]
* Balance correction for the Expeditions energy points;
* Fixed the cursor behavior;
* Removed an annoying window.

[h3][b]CONTROLS[/b][/h3]
* Added an option to turn off the smooth camera movement (motion sickness);
* During fishing, pressing the Escape button now pauses the game;
* Added the ability to rotate the camera by pressing Q (rotate left) and E (rotate right).

[h3][b]SAVE SYSTEM[/b][/h3]
* Fixed a bug where buildings would move after restoring progress;
* Fixed a bug where an updated building reset its grade level after the progress was restored;
* Fixed a bug where the garden bed couldn't save & restore its plants.

[h3][b]UI[/b][/h3]
* Tweaked the "Report a problem" button alignment;
* Fuel level value correction;
* Some improvements in the garden bed UI;
* Fixed a bug where the campfire's fuel level progress bar would disappear;
* Fixed a bug with the building hologram window blocker;
* Added an object rotation tutorial to Disassembly;
* Updated the message on the "Warning" screen. Added a warning message about motion sickness;
* Fixed the glow effect for rewards in Disassembly;
* Updated layouts for dialogues in Expeditions;
* Updated some icons, including the kettle icon for disassembly;
* Minor improvements for some UI elements.

[h3][b]LOCALIZATION[/b][/h3]
* Updated localization for UI and dialogues;
* The demo will automatically set the user's system language as default.

[h3][b]MISCELLANEOUS[/b][/h3]
* Fixed a glitch where an uncleaned infection puddle would remain in place even after the infection plant was destroyed;
* AI improvements for leeches (fixed leeches getting stuck or going around in circles);
* Added animations and some SFX for the cryptocurrency tab;
* Made the Radio tower zone buildable;
* Common improvements for the build stability.
